OL,3,GNEWSATown's theatre may shut in
OL,4,A'devastating' blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's "lifeline" theatre could be
OL,7,Fforced to close at the end of next
OL,8,Fmonth.
OL,10,FThe chair of Taunton Theatre
OL,11,FAssociation, a charity that runs the
OL,12,Ftown's Brewhouse Theatre, said the
OL,13,Fshock announcement came with "heartfelt
OL,14,Fregret".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
