OL,3,GNEWSATown's theatre may shut in
OL,4,A'devastating' blow
OL,5,
OL,6,FVal Hammond said all planned
OL,7,Fperformances and activities would
OL,8,Fcontinue until the end of October,
OL,9,Fwhile the trustees tried to raise funds
OL,10,Fand find ways to cut costs. "It will be
OL,11,Fdevastating for the whole town to lose
OL,12,Fsuch an important cultural venue," she
OL,13,Fsaid.
OL,15,FThe trustees said the theatre's
OL,16,Ffinancial problems came after a
OL,17,F"prolonged period of challenging
OL,18,Ftrading conditions" exacerbated by this
OL,19,Fsummer's heatwaves, which saw some
OL,20,Fshows cancelled.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
